Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:20.32,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1018.57)\b0\clip(m 544.8 870.4 l 631.2 998.4 846.4 1029.6 1210.4 856.8 1434.4 861.6 1503.2 1012 1438.4 1068.8 331.2 1039.2)}更衣{\c&HB68CEB&}人偶{\c&H4A586B&}坠入{\c&HB68CEB&}爱河
